        // cannot evaluate it there (buildMain emits class items in topological order, so
        // a delegate naming a top-level val is not bound yet), and the two halves must
        // run the `by` expression at the same moment; js_ktdmemo in abnf/jsrtkotlin.go
        // is the twin of this box.
        var box = {d: null, done: false}
